# PharmaAudit OS Project Rules
- Multi-tenancy: All tenant-scoped writes must execute inside `app.tenancy.pharmacy_context` or `pharmacy_context`. Never bypass `PharmacyAwareModel` validation except for `CustomUser` auth updates (`last_login`, `password`).
- Settings & Tests: Run tests locally using `DATABASE_URL='sqlite:///db.sqlite3' python manage.py test --noinput` before committing.
- Deployment Safety: Work on a feature branch (e.g., `feat/demo-polish`) and ask before committing to `main`.
- Secrets: Never read, log, or commit `.env` files or database credentials.
# --- Path Resolution Gotchas (src/ layout) ---
# BASE_DIR points to src/ (not repo root): settings.BASE_DIR = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent -> /path/to/src/
# PROJECT_ROOT = BASE_DIR.parent -> repo root
# Never use settings.BASE_DIR for app-relative paths inside src/
# Always resolve app-level files via Path(__file__).resolve().parent OR settings.PROJECT_ROOT

# --- Virtualenv Path ---
# Always activate or invoke /home/small_father/Downloads/fyp-main/.venv/bin/python directly when running manage.py commands
# Example: /home/small_father/Downloads/fyp-main/.venv/bin/python manage.py migrate
# Example: /home/small_father/Downloads/fyp-main/.venv/bin/python manage.py shell
# --- Cline Speed & Efficiency Rules ---
# Batching: Combine related shell checks, test runs, or git commands into a single terminal call instead of sequential round-trips.
# Edits: Use targeted `replace_in_file` diffs; never rewrite whole files with `write_to_file` when modifying existing code.
